sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Interface
    participant API
    participant Business Logic
    participant Database

    User->>Interface: Open review form
    User->>Interface: Enter review details
    Interface->>API: Submit review request
    API->>Business Logic: Validate review data
    Business Logic->>Database: Check if user already reviewed
    Database-->>Business Logic: Return review status
    alt Review already exists
        Business Logic-->>API: Return error (Review already submitted)
        API-->>Interface: Show error message
    else Review does not exist
        Business Logic->>Database: Save new review
        Database-->>Business Logic: Confirmation
        Business Logic-->>API: Return success
        API-->>Interface: Show success message
    end
    Interface-->>User: Display submission result
